  "description": "The miracle of a small agency, visual member Jung Ban-Han of idol group Blaze Tune, is beloved by many fans for his heavenly looks and character. Among Rix's countless fans, Lee Ju-Han's fandom grows so extreme it evolves into stalking. Believing his devotion betrayed by a small, careless action from Rix, Lee Ju-Han plans to kidnap him. He dips into his negative bank account and even resorts to illegal loans, spending money and time to uncover Rix's private life and home security code. Ultimately, he breaks into Rix's house and waits for him. Watching Rix secretly as he returns home, Lee Ju-Han witnesses an unexpected, chilling side of Rix...\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
